<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Four paper companies started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Four paper companies started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said Tuesday it had started coverage of four Canadian paper companies.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Andrew Root rated Abitibi-Price Inc, MacMillan Bloedel Ltd and Avenor Inc as market perform.</p>
<p>-- West Fraser Timber Co Ltd was rated market outperform.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
